sts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T20:33:56-07:00","id":212003,"title":"","content":"Go to Temenos and experience your favorite book as a character. (Just be careful not to get sucked into the creepy fan interpretation realms.)<br /> <br /> Actually share that horrible image you just had.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T21:30:38-07:00","id":212053,"title":"","content":"Use <b>Fate</b> to finally beat that fuckin' level on Candy Crush!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">\u263e</span></span></b></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/438-wulf","name":"wulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T21:32:35-07:00","id":212054,"title":"","content":"Mastigos:<br /> Go to the &quot;Missing/Absconded/Run-Away Children&quot; board at your local post office/Wal-Mart/what-have-you and go find the kids or their remains to give people closure.<br /> Experience what a higher intellect would be like.<br /> Explore <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BVn1oQL9sWg\" target=\"_blank\">space</a>.<br /> Teleport everywhere and never pay for fuel again.<br /> Crash any party you want, you belong there.<br /> Plumb the secrets from the mind of politicians<br /> <br /> Obrimos:<br /> Buy a Tesla, never pay for fuel again!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vB0QFGma_u8\" target=\"_blank\">Fire-spinning </a>without needing any props.<br /> <br /> Moros:<br /> Never pay for gas again!<br /> Freak out the Christians by turning water into bourbon.<br /> Crash the minerals market.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fe93CLbHjxQ\" target=\"_blank\">Who you gonna call?</a><br /> <br /> Thrysus:<br /> Alter some fungus to produce gasoline, never pay for gas again! (Gee, guess what I did today?)<br /> Basically everything sexual. Ever.<br /> Alter your saliva glands to make bourbon instead of saliva.<br /> <br /> Acanthus:<br /> After all this time, discover who let the dogs out.<br /> Buy a lottery ticket.<br /> Look into alternate timelines, watch Firefly seasons 2 through 10.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-28T21:40:51-07:00","id":212063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paddon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=212054#post212054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alter your saliva glands to make bourbon instead of saliva.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Fairly certain you'd be dead within hours.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Acanthus</b><br /> <br /> Alter the fates of every bully who picked on you in highschool, so they have a career bagging your groceries.<br /> <br /> <br /> Show people what life would be like if they were never born; earn your wings in the process.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Time + Space</b><br /> <br /> <br /> Legally change your name to &quot;The Doctor&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Travel to parallel Earths until you find one suitable to your liking.<br /> <br /> <br /> Send your enemies to alternate dimensions<br /> <br /> <br /> Create a miniature black hole inside somebody's skull.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 07-29-2014, 12:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-29T15:43:15-07:00","id":212877,"title":"","content":"Master the four elements of Water, Fire, Earth and Air, then tell people you're the Avatar.<br /> <br /> <br /> Walk into a cancer ward and heal everybody. You know, do something selfless with your godly powers!<br /> <br /> <br /> Create 1,000 paper cranes in under a minute, get a free wish!<br /> <br /> <br /> Blow shit up with your mind.<br /> <br /> <br /> Telekinetically milk a cow from 20 feet away.<br /> <br /> <br /> Bring extinct animals back to life. Ride a dinosaur into battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-29T20:39:30-07:00","id":213115,"title":"","content":"life - have someone wake up one morning as the opposite gender<br /> <br /> mind - when something happens to a person, they hallucinate an appropriate background sound. Laugh track, jarring chord, creepy and suspenseful music, narration...<br /> <br /> space + forces - when someone posts something stupid, punch them through the internet<br /> <br /> forces + mind - play your favorite games in full virtual reality. Mod them on the fly. Enjoy Blizzard trying to figure out how the Lich King was defeated with the Magic of Friendship.<br /> <br /> various - Find a motorcycle. Get a costume. The next time you go out to fight evil, do so as Kamen Rider Arcane! Don't forget to call your attacks.<br /> <br /> various - find a LARP. make things a little more realistic with some 'special effects'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1457-quanutmshard","name":"Quanutmshard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-30T05:30:34-07:00","id":213439,"title":"","content":"Fate - rewrite the fate of people who give a bad tip<br /> Time - rewind time and give those people a second chance...or third...or fourth... (basically Groundhog's Day them until they tip correctly)<br /> Death - Kill them (or their car, or their cat, or whatever)<br /> Matter - glue them to their seats until they tip properly<br /> Forces - make them experience severe static shocks on everything they touch<br /> Prime - make them see dollar bills laying on the ground that vanish every time they reach for them.<br /> Space - be wherever they go before them, accuse them of stalking, and get a retraining order<br /> Mind - manipulate them into tipping better<br /> Life - make them grow (or loose) body parts<br /> Spirit - talk their car's spirit into only making left turns when they're driving.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1798-nameandverb","name":"NameAndVerb","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1798_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-30T06:25:50-07:00","id":213479,"title":"","content":"<b>Life + Fate:</b> Create permanent physical alteration spells. Offer your services to certain social communities. Make a fortune.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Forces:</b> Pretend you're the Dragonborn by casting your spells from your mouth. Shout their names in syllables as you do so!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Time: </b>Rewind the clock on your 30 day free trials, never pay for a product again!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Life + Mind:</b> Perform extreme sex fetishes that would be illegal in all 50 states.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Forces:</b> Beat a car into scrap with your bare hands. Claim you must defeat M. Bison if anyone asks why.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T17:58:42-07:00","id":223738,"title":"","content":"<b>Death + Forces:</b> Rise this thread.<br /> <br /> <b>Life:</b> Create a troll.<br /> <br /> <b>Life + Forces:</b> Create an internet troll.<br /> <br /> <b>Fate:</b> Create fortune cookies that give good/bad luck to the people that opens them.<br /> <br /> <b>Life + Time:</b> Make seeds grow super-fast. Turn barren deforested places into huge forest in an afternoon.<br /> <br /> <b>Spirit:</b> dress up as a clown, sorround yourself with fear spirits and become creepier than the clown from Stephen King's It.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3456-sir-phobos","name":"Sir Phobos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T18:31:40-07:00","id":223745,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sir Phobos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=208413#post208413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message