r /> Play plants vs zombies IRL","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T15:28:46-07:00","id":226440,"title":"","content":"Turn yourself blue. Teleport to Mars, build a castle out of glass.<br /> <br /> Become a superhero. Watch as every single splat scrambles.<br /> <br /> Make yourself fireproof and then set yourself on fire. And then run into the Sanctum screaming nonsense.<br /> <br /> Make passers-by drunk.<br /> <br /> Obrimos: create a Prime illusion of something absolutely amazing, set it to radiate magic like mad. Leave it in a jungle somewhere. Leave clues.<br /> <br /> Magistos: make someone forget something important with Mind. Trace the sympathetic connections, make their friends and family forget as well.<br /> <br /> Acanthus: curse the bouncers in a casino not to be looking when you cheat outrageously.<br /> <br /> Moros: pump up a ghost and have it possess a vampire. No-one will ever work out what happened.<br /> <br /> Thrysus: become immune to cold. Build yourself a Fortress of Solitude in the arctic. Enslave the local Spirits, make them into elves.<br /> <br /> Use Mind to convince your cabal-mates of ... anything, really. Mind pranks are the best pranks. Nothing is real.<br /> <br /> Make your own Slenderman. Don't have him kill anyone. Just make him appear, and vanish.<br /> <hr /><br /> My only serious contribution: build a spaceship. Faster than light, self-repairing, the works. See the stars.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","cou