tle":"","content":"<b>Fate:</b> Locate the babe with the power. Steal it from them!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Forces:</b> Shoot fireballs from your eyes and lightning bolts from your ass!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Death + Life:</b> Create the T-Virus, become the real life Albert Whesker!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Prime:</b> When a fellow mage casts a spell at you, pimp smack it to the side.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T00:36:40-08:00","id":318036,"title":"","content":"Thyrsus: help spirits inhabit otherwise ordinary animals, proceed to organize a real life Pok\u00e9mon League... until the local Guardians of the Veil come down to break it up. Get them all adopted as familiars in the aftermath!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T02:00:21-08:00","id":318088,"title":"","content":"Mind: Dream Diving into your own imagination. Make worlds. Take psychic's and lucid dreamers on dream adventures to enlighten them... or just for kicks. <br /> <br /> Fate: Play high risk games..... with changelings, show them whats up.<br /> <br /> Space: Play paintball or tag... while jumping from states to countries.<br /> <br /> Life+Mind Learn how to become the things of your friends nightmares.<br /> <br /> (Being any kind of mage)- Laugh at hedge wizards<br /> <br /> Death&amp; Spirit: BeetleJuice &quot;nuff said&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T09:36:11-08:00","id":318311,"title":"","content":"Obrimos: Forces/Time/Fate/Space- hack into the world's largest supercomputer and render all nuclear missiles inert.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2682,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","user":"Kumiko","date":".  Always go with your 1st impression it's usually correct. 11-21-2014, 01:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","name":"Kumiko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2682_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T10:05:57-08:00","id":318327,"title":"","content":"You would require Space. &gt;_&gt;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T10:12:35-08:00","id":318332,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=318327#post318327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You would require Space. &gt;_&gt;</div> </div> </div> </div>I put it in there at first but removed it because I am not completely certain how 2e arcana work or what is needed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","name":"Kumiko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2682_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T07:12:43-08:00","id":318923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kumiko</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=318332#post318332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I put it in there at first but removed it because I am not completely certain how 2e arcana work or what is needed.</div> </div> </div> </div>why would you need Time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T07:22:45-08:00","id":318932,"title":"","content":"Oh! I see what you're doing. If you happen to be in front of the workd's largest super computer -and- it has access to all the world's nukes then no, Space isn't required. Technically, neither is Time or Fate, because Forces can hack just fine.<br /> <br /> Space is still about distance and sympathetic connections. A Space 2 Attainment for affecting things sympathetically is required to affect all nuclear weapons at once in 2e. That's only necessary if the super computer has access to only some or no nukes and you try to target all of them. You could also just skip the super computer part at that point and hack the nukes directly.<br /> <br /> I imagine Time 2 and Fate 2 could come in handy for creating a program which could be imbued to activate your nuke killing spell under a certain set of circumstances.<br /> <br /> Sorry, when I first read it I thought you were going for rendering the actual uranium inert. &gt;_&gt;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T11:05:49-08:00","id":319089,"title":"","content":"I was including Time and Fate as conditional trigger so as to not let anyone know what was done until they tried to actually use them not test or run dianogstics etc so as not to tipoff the SotT or Exarchs because that's a worldwide societal shift you're pulling off. And I assumed just having direct access to only a portion of the weapons hence the need for Space given there is no SkyNet in operation yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2682,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","user":"Kumiko","date":". 11-22-2014, 02:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","name":"Kumiko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2682_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T11:25:35-08:00","id":319099,"title":"","content":"I was suggesting a conditional trigger too, I just over-complicated it (a frequent problem) by assuming it would be an imbued item or program or something that carried the yet to be triggered spell. That's really not necessary though, good thinking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T13:56:15-08:00","id":319287,"title":"","content":"Another favorite is free money...Forces/Fate &quot;You're Bank Account Is Mine&quot;.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Fate is there to make sure you pick the perfect bank account. If you're Hardison add Space and your dedicated Yantra (4G cellphone). <br /> <br /> Leverage is such an awesome example of a mixed MtAw cabal and exactly how a higher Wisdom mage would do things as opposed to Constantine.<br /> <br /> Otherwise just go to any ATM and have at it if you're pressed for time but expect a Wisdom check for your arrogance. Unless it's an inured spell or some kind of legacy attainment. <br /> <br /> Forces/Fate/Space 2 should work just fine if you just HAVE to be Hardison rather then Parker.<br /> <br /> Parker is a classic Mastigos with a legacy that gives Life as a path arcanum while Hardison is pure Obrimos with a legacy that gives Fate as a path Arcanum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2682,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","user":"Kumiko","date":". 11-22-2014, 10:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","name":"Kumiko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2682_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T14:29:36-08:00","id":319312,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sir Phobos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=208413#post208413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Moros</b>[*]Make a lot of squirrels ride a flock of doves, disguise yourself as a crazy hobo and start screaming &quot;The revolution has began!&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Literally laughed out loud at that one","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T04:19:58-08:00","id":352541,"title":"","content":"Moros:<br /> <br /> 1) Use Transmute Earth to make make any meal you want on the spot. Never pay for food again.<br /> 2) When someone points a gun at you, laugh and <a href=\"http://www.scp-wiki.net/clef101\" target=\"_blank\">turn the gun into a fuckin' bagel.</a><br /> 3) Make food and drink that are just like the normal version, but actually work like super potent laxatives.<br /> 4) Use Matter + Fate to curse someone so that their lower body garments spontaneously combust when they are untruthful.<br /> 5) X-Ray vision, ooh la la. You can also use Matter + Fate to give someone this ability, but only when they look at ugly people.<br /> <br /> Thyrsus:<br /> <br /> 1) Use Life + Fate to put a curse on someone so that they turn green and speak in third person when they're angry (but don't gain super strength).<br /> 2) Create a Familiar that is just like your favorite Pok\u00e9mon/Digimon/Neopet.<br /> 3) Achieve 5 dots in Life, call any injury &quot;just a flesh wound&quot;.<br /> <br /> Mastigos:<br /> <br /> 1) Shout &quot;YOU SHALL NOT PASS&quot; when casting Wards, even if no one is there.<br /> 2) Use Mind + Fate to curse someone so that they see women as men and men as women.<br /> 3) Use Mind + Fate to curse someone so that whenever they say something obscene, what others actually hear is a loud beep or miscellaneous sounds (car honks, elephant roars, ruber duckies being squeezed, atomic explosions, hissing steam etc).<br /> 4) Use Mind + Fate to make someone think a specific work of fiction is real. Watch grown ass men talk back to the Teletubbies.<br /> <br /> Obrimos:<br /> <br /> 1) Use Forces + Space to hack anything, anywhere.<br /> 2) Use a Prime + Fate + Mind spell to create a magic sword that can only be used by those of pure heart. When that happens, the Mind part makes them hear the Thundercats theme song. Alternatively, the sword makes the wielder shout &quot;IIIIII HAAAVE THE POOOWWW-ERRRRRRR&quot;.<br /> 3) Use Prime + Forces to create an Imbued Item in the shape of a wand and shout pseudo latin when using it.<br /> <br /> Acanthus:<br /> <br /> 1) When someone tells you that your plan has a one in a million chance of working, say &quot;never tell me the odds&quot;. Then, use Fate subtly to succeed and make you look like a total badass.<br /> 2) Use Time to straight up do <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qtnMy2aSOWQ\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T06:26:18-08:00","id":352607,"title":"","content":"Mages are OP as fuck....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T06:41:48-08:00","id":352618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyr