ankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-11T16:56:11-08:00","id":366730,"title":"","content":"Life + Mind:<br /> <br /> Create a clone with the head of Chuck Norris, the body of Bruce Lee, and the aggressiveness of Steven Seagal<br /> <br /> Unleash your Bruce Norris clone upon the Abyss and wait for it to clear a path to the supernal realms!<br /> <br /> <br /> Transform your body from the neck down into a copy of Bruce Lee (if you're Asian)<br /> <br /> Transform your body into a copy of Chuck Norris from the neck down (if you're white)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T14:33:17-08:00","id":377545,"title":"","content":"Take part in a LARP as a wizard. All vulgar magic becomes improbable, you're just that good at LARPing<br /> <br /> Freeze your enemy at his exact coordinates in Space. Watch as the Earth falls away from him at 30 km/s<br /> <br /> Literally blow a kiss at someone.<br /> <br /> Literally give someone an internet hug.<br /> <br /> View the world in Imaginary Space and Imaginary Time (be trippin' ballz)<br /> <br /> Turn the sky blood-red<br /> <br /> Switch Light and Dark around<br /> <br /> Create a contagious, but harmless disease that makes people giggle nonstop<br /> <br /> Create an 8th day of the week.<br /> <br /> Make someone always see something out of the corner of their eye","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4652-rising","name":"Rising","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/