 in time to warn you abou- &quot;, then return to the future</li> </ul><br /> (then discover that the future is nothing but Paradox)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4652-rising","name":"Rising","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4652_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T19:23:11-08:00","id":383891,"title":"","content":"Use Life + Space to connect your limbs to your body so that they still work when cut off.<br /> <br /> Chop off your own head and carry it around like it ain't no thang.<br /> <br /> Hope nobody dispels it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T06:12:02-08:00","id":384161,"title":"","content":"Use Life to shift your vital organs to ridiculous places in your body.<br /> <br /> Add Space to shift your vital organs to ridiculous places out of your body and still have them work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Wow I wish I had something cool to say here</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123","name":"dman1123","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T18:34:46-08:00","id":384675,"title":"","content":"Life + Fate - Introduce yourself as Merlin. Turn future national leaders into animals for a day!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T22:38:41-08:00","id":384822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=384675#post384675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Life + Fate - Introduce yourself as Merlin. Turn future national leaders into animals for a day!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I can't really understand what you are trying to do here. find future leaders with fate and turn them into animals with life? What's the point? they will disbelive anyway. Also, you can't turn into merlin, dude was so badass that exarch of fate destroyed camelot out of spite.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4340,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","user":"Warpwind","date":". 01-29-2015, 01:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T04:11:13-08:00","id":384900,"title":"","content":"From what I know of the lore, Merlin educated the future King Arthur by turning him into animals including squirrels and fish. I forgot what lesson he was teaching him at the time, but it was important for a king to know!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T04:37:44-08:00","id":384903,"title":"","content":"Yeah, but the Merlin in MtA is different, he was mentioned somewhere. But, again, what's the point? they will just forget the experience, awaken, or go mad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T04:51:36-08:00","id":384909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=384900#post384900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I know of the lore, Merlin educated the future King Arthur by turning him into animals including squirrels and fish. I forgot what lesson he was teaching him at the time, but it was important for a king to know!</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Bridgekeeper:</b> What... is the air-speed velocity of an unladen swallow?<br /> <b>King Arthur:</b> What do you mean? An African or a European swallow?<br /> <b>Bridgekeeper:</b> Huh? I... I don't know that. AUUUUUUUGGGGGGGGGGGHHH!!<br /> <b>Sir Bedevere:</b> How do you know so much about swallows?<br /> <b>King Arthur:</b> Well, you have to know these things when you're a king, you know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4652-rising","name":"Rising","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4652_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T06:26:00-08:00","id":384942,"title":"","content":"That particular bit of Merlin lore actually stems from T.H. White's &quot;The Once and Future King&quot;, which other than Malory's &quot;Le Mort d'Arthur&quot; and Geoffrey of Monmouth's &quot;History of the Kings of Britain&quot;- the books that forms the basis of just about every collection of King Arthur stories commonly available in bookstores -is a major source of Arthurian knowledge in public consciousness, especially after Disney loosely adapted it into &quot;The Sword in the Stone&quot;.<br /> <br /> That being said, MtAw Merlin was still immensely awesome- any archmage immediately qualifies for it. Him even more so if Morganna was indeed one of the legendary insane rogue Acanthus archmages, and even more so if she was- say -a True Fae. He was so awesome that even after the Exarch of Fate punched Camelot out of existence with the Almighty Reset Button in the Edit War for Reality [&quot;Note Important Capital Letters. Mages Use Lots of Capital Letters.&quot;], they couldn't eliminate all of his affect on the world, because a part of the legend Merlin created managed to ascend to Aeon status and take over the Aeon of Fate. Which is how we get Medraut there. Yup. Merlin is crazy awesome, and a badass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":4152,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","user":"Arcanist","date":". 01-29-2015, 09:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T08:52:17-08:00","id":385113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=384942#post384942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-