7:00","id":1137409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Warpwind</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=1137408#post1137408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bbecause you would actually take the happiness. You actually take the good from their Fates and give them petty money for it. Family, children, health, anything that makes one happy - to be exchanged for a few cuts of paper. Fitting punishment for cynicism, I can imagine a Mastigos doing it. Hmm... maybe a legacy? with trading in destiny as both attainment and oblation?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ah, I got it backwards. I thought you were selling happiness, not buying","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-04T12:50:57-07:00","id":1137410,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=1137372#post1137372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why would this one require magic?</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, if you wanted to make the transfer actually <i>work</i>...<br /> <br /> But anyway:<br /> <br /> Use Time so that you can sleep in and still be on time for things.<br /> <br /> Use Mind to know what everyone wants on the pizza. Then buy pizza for everyone (it's a great icebreaker)!<br /> <br /> Use Prime+Matter to make an everlasting tub of ice-cream. Bonus points if you make it literally taste like happiness.<br /> <br /> Use Prime to turn the tub of ice-cream into a Grimoire. Make sure that the only way to learn the Rotes inside is to eat it.<br /> <br /> Start a business selling ice-cream Grimoires. For some extra cash on the side, sell Sleepers some <i>really</i> exotic flavors (&quot;What flavor is 'Mother's Love'? It's just dulce de leche with caramel chunks, along with our... secret ingredient. Would you like a sampler?&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-04T12:57:37-07:00","id":1137418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Warpwind</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/208132-fun-activities-as-a-mage?p=1137369#post1137369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See how many total retards will agree.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:red\">Using that word pejoratively is not acceptable on these forums.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-04T13:27:41-07:00","id":1137430,"title":"","content":"Find a spirit of physics, literally break them.<br /> <br /> <br /> Transport people through time by punching them.<br /> <br /> <br /> Summon goetia of your deepest fantasies while getting high as a kite.<br /> <br /> <br /> Strap a pair of cardboard wings to your arms. Make your friends watch as you fly from the roof of your house.<br /> <br /> <br /> Attend social gatherings with the fair folk. Make passive aggressive remarks about their lack of creativity.<br /> <br /> <br /> Graft a pair of working legs to a shark's abdomen. Give it the ability to breathe air. Release it upon the city streets!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-04-2017, 04:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-05T10:52:19-07:00","id":1137759,"title":"","content":"Imbue a television to Scry on your (or another's) Oineros. Record the actions of the Goetia therein for some Inside Out entertainment.<br /> <br /> Enchant a food animal with Indefinite Regeneration (and, ideally, no sense of pain). Sell endless whatever-kebobs.<br /> <br /> For bonus points, make the animal mythical or have odd flavors. <br /> <br /> For even more extra-credit, see if you can make it Tass. Market it as &quot;magically nutritious and delicious&quot;.<br /> <br /> Combine Fate and Space to deliver packages <i>right before</i> competitors. Convert the Resonance of their frustration into Essence or Mana to recoup costs.<br /> <br /> Guard a vault/tomb with bound zombies. Make the pass-key reenacting the dance of Thriller, which the guardians will mirror.<br /> <br /> Enchant a wishing well to actually use Fate magic to grant wishes. But only if the wisher throws in an new/different coin. Use this to complete your collection.<br /> <br /> Use powerful Mind, Forces, and Spirit magic... to make bystanders act like they are in a musical.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-05-2017, 02:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-08T20:29:38-07:00","id":1138787,"title":"","content":"Surround your home in a time dilation bubble. Never have to suffer waiting for release dates again!<br /> <br /> Rearrange somebody's sense of taste and smell, see how long it takes them to start vomiting in disgust.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T23:08:43-07:00","id":1140431,"title":"","content":"Achieve mastery of Space and Time and at least apprentice in Mind and Life. Homebrew a spell so that your cabal mates can always see through your disguises but no one else can. Create multiple persona's and lives. Become Roger the alien from American Dad. Pansexualtiy, alcoholism and sociopathy are advantages but not required for this gag.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13691-margul","name":"Margul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T05:43:06-07:00","id":1140491,"title":"","content"